WEBVTT


00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.599
<i>- Da?
- Your cover's blown.</i>


00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.602
<i>- Go to the embassy now.</i>
- Okay.


00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:11.937
<i>Da.</i>


