00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.682
- Tell him the code 13.
- Sorry?


00:02:30.776 --> 00:02:32.859
I'm a diplomat. Call him now!


00:02:33.195 --> 00:02:34.402
Stay here.


00:02:59.262 --> 00:03:02.130
