00:05:50.392 --> 00:05:53.931
I'm sure you're a fast learner.
And anyway, we take care of everything.


00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:56.763
Training, accommodation,
visa, documentation.


00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.807
