00:10:26.292 --> 00:10:28.705
Yeah. Okay.


00:10:30.755 --> 00:10:33.589
Yeah!


00:10:36.136 --> 00:10:38.219
Yeah. Crazy, totally crazy.


00:10:59.868 --> 00:11:01.575
- Ciao, Anna.
- Ciao, Renata.


